% LockableCoin.Unlock (consuming): the controller (locker) must submit it, and the contract must be active
when a party exercises unlock on the lockable coin a lockable coin creating a second lockable coin
    and the lockable coin is a lockable coin with owner an owner, issuer an issuer, amount an amount and locker a locker
